profile: runtime-mirust.next-recursive-prompt.v6
updated_utc: 2026-07-01T15:30:00Z
prompt: >
  Continue in E:\Source\Rust\SLMComposer.com as the active Rust workspace for SLMComposer.com / TinyRustLM, with E:\Source\Rust\MiniModel.org as the MiniModel.org site workspace. The site-folder split, source-control cleanup, MiniModel intake processing, roadmap, and first MiniModel implementation docs are complete. Start the next work by planning or scaffolding the local Rust verifier (`minimodel-core` plus CLI) from E:\Source\Rust\MiniModel.org\docs\manifest-v0.md and docs\verifier-mvp.md. Keep SLMComposer.com browser-local and keep project servers metadata-only: no server-side user model execution and no project-server user model bytes.
primary_goal: >
  Move from MiniModel.org schema/docs into the first local Rust verifier implementation path: manifest parsing, boundary rejection, artifact checksum verification, TinyRustLM compatibility checks, and local import receipts, before any peer networking.
